---
# GT spawn record (size/pose/mass/model) for sim physics backends, eval
# fixtures, scoring, and viz. Chain modules (perception/planning/motion)
# must use the measured sub-record on /luggage/current_box instead; this
# service is the privileged pull path (docs/architecture/privilege_boundary.md).
DetectedLuggage box
bool success
string message
int32 generation
float64 mass_kg
string model_name
